# Screenshots directory

This directory will contain the five screenshots for the README once `scripts/capture/capture.sh` is run:

- `01-dashboard.png` - Dashboard view with repository groups
- `02-history.png` - Commit history with visual graph
- `03-working-tree.png` - Working tree with changes
- `04-branches.png` - Branch list with tracking info
- `05-settings.png` - Repository settings

Run `bash scripts/capture/capture.sh` to generate these screenshots.
